This repository vendors third-party Go modules under the vendor/ directory.
Those modules remain under their respective licenses (typically Apache-2.0,
MIT, or BSD). See each module’s LICENSE (or equivalent) file inside vendor/
for details. Notable direct dependencies include:

  - github.com/prometheus/client_golang
  - github.com/prometheus/exporter-toolkit
  - golang.org/x/sys

Linux kernel UAPI constants and wire formats for ethtool/netlink are used
as published by the Linux kernel project; this software does not link against
the upstream ethtool userspace binary.
